  "description": "Curated SecHub Resources SC4S pack for Fortinet FortiGate/FortiOS key=value syslog records. Extends upstream SC4S FortiOS inventory with conservative metadata, parser/env artifacts, Splunk knowledge, synthetic-equivalent fixtures, and explicit validation gaps.",
